<#f0f000>:Jill Specific Mechanics:
<#00a2e8>Smoking recovery</>
When she uses Smoking, her meter and life are gradually 
restored.

<#00a2e8>Bash break</>
Her Bash and EX Bash can cancel out the opponent's 
projectiles. Furthermore, if she hits them during 
their attack, the opponent's hitpausetime is increased, 
and if the opponent is in the air, the opponent is 
brought down to the ground.

<#00a2e8>Slip wine</>
Her Slippery Wine and EX Slippery Wine puddle cannot 
be guarded against by the opponent. Furthermore, 
if the opponent steps on the puddle, the opponent falls 
and cannot move for a while, and in that state, 
the opponent cannot burst.

<#00a2e8>Alcoholic Power</>
She can use Recovery alcohol to recover her life and 
also recover all of her burst meter.